183	// GetByAgentType retrieves an agent by its type identifier.
184	//
185	// Note: This uses a linear search that instantiates agents until a match is found.
186	// This is acceptable because:
187	//   - Agent count is small (~2-20 agents)
188	//   - Agent factories are lightweight (empty struct allocation)
189	//   - Called infrequently (commit hooks, rewind, debug commands - not hot paths)
